Hi,

I have released version 2.6 of SATDOC.
This update improves the treatment of AMSAT ANS bulletins for extraction 
of satellite documentations.

SATDOC 2.6 can be downloaded from the following URL :

ftp://nephtys.lip6.fr/jussieu/labos/physio/satdoc/2.6

For simplification you will find 16 bits MSDOS, Win32/DOS and
Linux binary executables as well as source code satdoc26.c.

Documentation and usage example can be found in earlier versions 
directories.

This is an utility program for packet radio F6FBB's BBS, taking care
of individual satellite documentation file updates from AMSAT NEWS SERVICE
bulletins sent over packet radio network.

No Sysops intervention is needed as soon as the program is setup as it 
is activated during xfbbd daily maintenance.

Any comments and reports are welcome.

